      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Luke was the only installer from my shortlist who actually came to my house to speak in person about my solar requirements. LPS don’t just do solar, they are fully qualified electricians. We wanted a bigger and higher quality system than the average household to cater for our current energy needs and future battery/EV upgrades. Luke was very helpful on the options and the design for our house. His team was always on time and friendly. The quote was competitive, noting that we weren’t looking for the cheapest option. We settled on REC Alpha Pure R panels and two 5kW Fronius inverters, basically two systems in one, totalling 10.92 kW. As a bonus, Luke has the REC installers certificate which gets the 25-year warranty. We had some teething issues on the setup, but these were fixed promptly and at no extra cost. I definitely would recommend LPS for your solar install, because you know you have a fully qualified electrician.",
